 "messages": [
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Emily! I haven’t heard from you in forever!"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Hey, Mike. I just HAD to tell you…"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "You are NOT going to believe who I ran into at lunch today."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Who?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Guess!"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "I have no idea."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "No, Guess!"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Charlie?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Huh? No, why would it be Charlie?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "I don’t know. He works downtown."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Not Charlie."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Guess again."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Why are you making such a big thing out of this?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Because it’s amazing. I’m having him over at the party tonight."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "WHO?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Remember little Kenny…in middle school? The dorky kid?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "WHAT?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "I ran into him!"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Isn’t that amazing?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "No, it’s NOT amazing."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "You don’t know about him, do you?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "What do you mean?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "I thought you would have heard."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "It’s all over the news: he’s wanted."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "What do you mean, “wanted?”"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "By the police. FBI."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "That’s crazy!"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "How can you NOT know this?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "You’re joking."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Emily, they want him for murder."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "That’s crazy. I know he was weird, but that was a long time ago."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "I’m serious! It was on the news!"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "I don’t watch the news."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "You’re seriously having him over?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "He knows where you live?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "I told you, I’m having a party. In a couple of hours."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "And anyway, He didn’t look like someone who’s wanted."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "So maybe you’re wrong."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Maybe it was just someone with the same name."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "It was HIM. Don’t you remember how weird he was?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Hold on…front door."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Is it him???"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "He’s there already?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "I thought he wasn’t coming until later!!"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Well…he came early."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "He’s there?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Emily, you have to get away!"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Are you sure about him?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Yes!"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "I really think you’re wrong. He’s sitting right across from me."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Can you get out of there?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Don’t try to get me excited."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Stay calm. What’s he saying?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "He’s asking how I am."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Tell him you’re okay."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "I did, and I told him I’m texting my mom."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "I don’t think he liked you back then."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "I’m going to call the police"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "He hasn’t done anything."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Except murder! Get out while you still can!"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "I’m not doing that."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "He’s being polite."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "He said it’s good to see me. See, he’s nice."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "He’s saying he hasn’t seen a lot of people from middle school."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "He says it wasn’t a good time for him."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Yeah. He was a dork."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "He says nobody liked him."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Mike…he’s getting mad talking about it."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Stay calm."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "I can see it in his face."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "See what?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "How mad he is. His face is all red."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "He said he hated everyone."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "But he said he won’t hate anymore."
  },
  {
