   "text": "What does he mean?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "Well…"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "He said its getting better."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "He got rid of the bad people he says."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "…most of the bad people"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Got RID of them?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "That’s what he said."
  },
  {
   "from": "Emily",
   "text": "“Most.”"
  },
  {
