   "text": "People he didn’t like. From middle school."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Which people?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "We were nice to him, weren’t we?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "I can’t really remember."
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Emily?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Weren’t we  nice to him?"
  },
  {
   "from": "Mike",
   "text": "Emily?"
